tures:\n\nPlay against our AI opponent with 3 difficulty levels.\nReal-time Physically Based Lighting\nSupports 90Hz on Quest 2\n\nFull game roadmap / Planned features (some will be free with the demo, some will be In App Purchases).\n\nMultiplayer & Social Features (perfect for future lockdowns!).\nHand Tracking support.\nAchievements, Leaderboards & more.\nCustomisable / Multiple environment.\nMusic player (details to be confirmed).\n\n", "short_description": "Did you ever fancy owning an Air Hockey Table but didn't have the space?  Air Hockey Arcade gives you an Air Hockey Table inside your headset.\n\nPlay against our AI opponent with 3 different difficulty levels."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.guiltydog.co.uk/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Guilty Dog Productions Ltd.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://airhockeyarcade.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "2776542286000603"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["SPORTS", "CASUAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "538288183868280"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 2, "nodes": [{"status": "PENDING", "id": "1281941767459898"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "500124581036956"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "500124581036956"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 0, "status": "PENDING", "id": "1281941767459898"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "26928632030102561", "version": "1.8.17"}, "id": "422830308975458", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "3795616697164088", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26928632030102561"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "422830308975458"}]}, "change_log": "Network Quality Feedback Panel.\nVarious QoL tweaks, most notably saved settings are loaded before the Meta entitlement check completes.\nBug fixes relating to opponent avatar selection in multiplayer games.", "created_date": 1778582683, "id": "26928632030102561", "version": "1.8.17", "version_code": 59, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "3795616697164088", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26928632030102561"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "422830308975458"}]}, "change_log": "Upgraded FMOD and Oculus Spatializer to latest versions.  (Will hopefully fix an FMOD crash).\nUse premultiplied alpha for GUI transparency.  (Buttons on transparent GUI panels will render correctly in MR mode).\nDisable Avatar hands if not tracked.\n Fix potential crash selecting alternate avatars.\nApply table transform in MR mode to GUI (you can position the table in your room using the thumbsticks).\nPersist setting changes made in main menu.", "created_date": 1777557343, "id": "26791967970435635", "version": "1.8.16", "version_code": 58, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "3795616697164088", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26928632030102561"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "422830308975458"}]}, "change_log": "Prevent switching alternate avatars too quickly.  May fix a crash bug.\nDiscord button on Support page. Should open Meta Horizon browser to Discord page.\nVarious stability tweaks particularly around OpenXR.\nRe-enabled avatars for users on HorizonOS v2.3.1034 PTC.", "created_date": 1777047468, "id": "26720830260882740", "version": "1.8.15", "version_code": 57, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "3795616697164088", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26928632030102561"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "422830308975458"}]}, "change_log": "Fixed a number of issues in the previous build. Most notably it should no longer crash the first time you connect to Epic Online Services for multi player.\nRe-enabled voice chat in multi player.\nButtons for restarting the current and last point in multi player and current point and game in single player.\nDisable pointer in mainmenu and with GUI displayed and the game loses focus, say when bringing up the Universal Menu.", "created_date": 1776524840, "id": "26654135014218932", "version": "1.8.14", "version_code": 56, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "3795616697164088", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26928632030102561"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "422830308975458"}]}, "change_log": "In Mixed Reality (MR) mode, you can move the table using the thumb sticks. (Left: change position, Right: rotate).\n\nKnown issues:\n\nCurrently there is no way to end a game in progress.  This will be fixed in the next build.\n\nIf you change the paddle / puck sizes during game play, you may get a phantom version lingering about. but your paddle and the active puck will go through it.  Toggling VR / MR once or twice should fix it.\n\nThere 'may' be an issue in multiplayer if you select different paddle / puck sizes.\n\nThere 'may' be a crash if you cycle through the alternate avatars after a while.", "created_date": 1774537886, "id": "26407418182223951", "version": "1.8.13", "version_code": 55, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}